# Rendered output of the design notes; the .md source is the tracked original
*.pdf
*.html
*.tex
*.log

# Per-fit benchmark scratch. Each fit writes one file here so a run is
# crash-resumable; the tracked artifact is the assembled baseline-*.rds.
benchmarks/results/

# The large corpus (28 MB) is derived deterministically from data/nih.rda with
# no sampling step, so it is reproducible exactly by re-running build-corpora.R
# and is not worth carrying in the repository. small.rds and nih-1000.rds stay
# tracked: nih-1000 depends on a seeded sample, so a stored copy is the only
# guarantee that the Phase 1 baseline remains comparable.
benchmarks/data/nih-full.rds
